<Page title="Contact MySpaFilter" description="Report a cross-reference error or ask a question about MySpaFilter.">
<h1>Contact</h1>
<p>Found a wrong part number, a dimension that doesn't match your cartridge, or a filter we should add? We want to hear about it. Please include the OEM number printed on your cartridge, your measured diameter and length, and the page URL.</p>
<p class="card">Open a public report on GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/dovnud/myspafilter.com/issues/new" rel="nofollow">github.com/dovnud/myspafilter.com/issues</a></p>
<p>We read every correction, and when a source confirms the change we update the data and the page's source citation.</p>
</Page>
